WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:04.104 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Sur le coup, moi,

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:05.105 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je n'ai pas voulu parler

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:06.139 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'un attentat politique.

00:00:04.438 --> 00:00:07.174 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En entrevue aux "Coulisses

00:00:05.439 --> 00:00:10.844 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du pouvoir", l'ancienne première

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:11.845 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre Pauline Marois avoue

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:12.879 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avoir regretté ce choix.

00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:13.880 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Elle ne voulait pas exacerber

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:17.250 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ion, déjà tendue,

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:20.887 size:53% position:73% line:53%
entre le Parti québécois et

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:21.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la communauté anglo-québécoise.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:22.923 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:25.359 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pourtant, tous les critères

00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:27.894 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'un attentat politique

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:28.929 size:53% position:73% line:53%
étaient rassemblés.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.963 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pauline! Pauline! Oui!

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.964 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ce soir-là, les péquistes

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:33.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
acclament leur cheffe,

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:37.471 size:53% position:73% line:53%
devenue la première femme

00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:38.505 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à diriger la province.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:39.506 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:40.540 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 D'un coup, ses gardes du corps

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:42.709 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se précipitent sur elle.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.744 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Elle est évacuée

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.778 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en catastrophe.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.779 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Est-ce que, Martine,

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:49.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous êtes sur place?

00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:50.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Aucune idée, Patrice,

00:00:46.113 --> 00:00:51.718 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de ce qui vient de se passer.- e

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:52.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
éclate à l'arrière

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:53.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du Metropolis.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les anglais sont réveillés.

00:00:53.754 --> 00:00:55.856 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Payback!

00:00:54.321 --> 00:01:01.962 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d Henry Bain,

00:00:55.155 --> 00:01:02.996 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lourdement armé, est ensuite

00:00:56.189 --> 00:01:04.564 size:53% position:73% line:53%
arrêté par la police.

00:01:02.296 --> 00:01:05.565 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Il aura tué un technicien

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de scène et blessé un deuxième.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:11.138 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Mais Bain visait

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:12.172 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la nouvelle premi

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:13.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre et ses partisans.

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:14.207 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pauline Marois, quant à elle,

00:01:12.506 --> 00:01:16.276 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est retournée sur scène

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.277 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour terminer son discours

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:20.514 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de victoire.

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:23.917 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est un exemple d'une femme

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:24.951 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cheffe d'État, voilà!

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:25.986 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:01:24.418 --> 00:01:27.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
te seule journée

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:28.021 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du 4 septembre 2012, la Sûreté

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:29.055 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du Québec avait enregistré

00:01:27.354 --> 00:01:31.391 size:53% position:73% line:53%
six menaces sérieuses

00:01:28.355 --> 00:01:32.426 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à son endroit. Dix ans plus

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:37.731 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tard, Pauline Marois se désoleds

00:01:31.725 --> 00:01:38.732 size:53% position:73% line:53%
antidémocratique, qu'elle

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:39.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
attribue à l'élection

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:40.801 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Donald Trump.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:41.802 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PAULINE MAROIS, ancienne

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.836 size:53% position:73% line:53%
première ministre du Québec

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:46.072 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce niveau de violence,

00:01:42.002 --> 00:01:47.073 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'agression verbalion verbalione

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:49.109 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de risque a augmenté.

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:50.143 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une tension exacerbée

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:51.178 size:53% position:73% line:53%
durant les campagnesélectoralest

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:52.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la radicalisation.

00:01:50.477 --> 00:02:02.889 size:53% position:73% line:53%
LOUIS AUDET GOSSELIN, directeur

00:01:51.511 --> 00:02:03.924 size:53% position:73% line:53%
scientifique et stratégique

00:01:52.879 --> 00:02:04.791 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La niveau des menaces

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:05.659 size:53% position:73% line:53%
augmente, et la précision

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.526 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des menaces augmente aussi.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.427 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il y a une personnalisation

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:08.295 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des menat assezt assezt assezt z

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.196 size:53% position:73% line:53%
inquiétante.

00:02:07.761 --> 00:02:10.096 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La Sûreté du Québec a mis

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.964 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en place une ligne téléphonique

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.865 size:53% position:73% line:53%
uniquement pour les candidats,

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais est-ce efficace?

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:13.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
FRANÇOIS DORÉ, ex-membre

00:02:12.366 --> 00:02:14.468 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ûreté du Québec

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.368 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La personne qui a des menaces

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:16.236 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chez elle devant sa maison

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.137 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par d'autres personnes

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:18.905 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne fera pas la ligne...

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.773 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne composera pas cette ligne,

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:20.674 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais va appeler directementle 9,

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle est utile, mais elle a

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:22.442 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quand même ses limites aussi.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:23.343 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En attendant, la sécurité

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:24.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se resserre autour des chefs

00:02:22.776 --> 00:02:25.078 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de partis. Mais le débat devra

00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:32.085 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dépasser l'ajout de policier

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:34.054 size:53% position:73% line:53%
estiment des experts.

00:02:25.412 --> 00:02:35.055 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il en va de la défense

00:02:32.419 --> 00:02:37.257 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la démocratie.

00:02:34.388 --> 00:02:37.257 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Marie-Josée Paquette-

